# Scene Patterns (Project Recipe)

## Current project shape

- Asset loading centralized in `src/game/assets.ts`.
- Scene composition in `src/game/scenes/*`.
- Entity behavior in `src/game/entities/*`.

## Recommended scene template

1. Set deterministic scene constants (`worldW`, `worldH`, `tileSize`).
2. Spawn map layers/terrain.
3. Spawn environment props/buildings.
4. Spawn player and NPC entities.
5. Wire interactions/events.
6. Configure camera and clamps.

## Transition rules

- Enter gameplay scene only after assets are guaranteed loaded.
- Keep menu and world scenes independent and re-enterable.
- Avoid singleton scene-local mutable state outside scene callback.
